<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept rice exports soar 625.8 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept rice exports soar 625.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's rice exports reached 210,000 tonnes in the first nine months, up 625.8 percent from the same period last year, according to customs figures quoted in the Futures Herald newspaper.</p>
<p>Rice exports in September were 60,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>The sharp rises are over a low base from last year.</p>
<p>China's rice imports slumped 66.4 percent to 480,000 tonnes in the first nine months, compared with the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports in September alone were 50,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
